window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-075-a0a279d6217273cb.json"]={sha256:"a0a279d6217273cb4df9225fc5400e71653cd3d6fef67a11fb6fe2abfad671fa",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-f7c2cb512e0ab948","url":"https://volatility3.readthedocs.io/en/latest/symbol-tables.html","title":"Volatility 3 symbol tables","titleEn":"Volatility 3 symbol tables","publisher":"Volatility Foundation","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-075","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-075","related":[{"id":"security-v27-076","referenceUrls":["https://docs.velociraptor.app/docs/clients/monitoring/"],"title":"Velociraptor：離線監測緩衝與回連後缺口帳本","titleEn":"Velociraptor: offline monitoring buffers and reconnect gap accounting","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付image-symbol-matrix.csv、plugin-status.json、rerun-manifest.json及analysis-gaps.md；交付包只有合成狀態，不含真實記憶體或秘密。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver image-symbol-matrix.csv, plugin-status.json, rerun-manifest.json and analysis-gaps.md. Include only synthetic status records, no real memory or secrets, and identify each image still excluded from analytical conclusions.","difference":"為監測配置、事件序號、緩衝上限與回連收據建立版本帳本；比較可保存時間窗，不把示範FIFO當成產品的所有實作保證。","differenceEn":"Version the monitoring configuration, event sequence, buffer limit and reconnect receipts. Compare retained time windows while clearly avoiding any claim that the illustrative FIFO describes every product implementation.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["Volatility 3依賴適當符號與記憶體層；符號存在不代表與映像相容，需求失敗屬未知結果，不應建立空的成功程序清單。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 10份合成映像中8份符號相容，其中7份外掛成功、1份讀取失敗；另外2份符號不符。所有建置與檔名皆為教學代號。 符號相容率8/10=80%，可分析覆蓋7/10=70%；相容且失敗的那份不能算成功，兩種比率不可互換。","Velociraptor用端點事件查詢執行監測；本課另定每秒固定速率、滿載丟最舊及無壓縮的合成模型，真實保留需查實際設定。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 離線600秒，每秒5筆，共3000序號；緩衝只容2000筆。以事件數而非位元組建模，回連後假設完整送出仍保留的資料。 緩衝保留2000/5=400秒，最初1000筆無法由此緩衝補回；保存比例2000/3000=66.666667%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Volatility 3 depends on suitable symbols and memory layers. A symbol file being present does not establish image compatibility; unmet requirements produce an unknown result rather than a successful empty process inventory. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Of ten synthetic images, eight have compatible symbols: seven plugins complete and one encounters a read failure. Two other images have incompatible symbols. Builds and filenames are original teaching identifiers. Symbol compatibility is 8/10=80%, but analyzable coverage is 7/10=70%. The compatible image with failed execution is not successful, and these two proportions cannot substitute for one another.","Velociraptor supports endpoint monitoring through event queries. This fixture separately assumes fixed event rate, oldest-first eviction and no compression; actual retention must be established from the deployed configuration. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. The endpoint is offline for 600 seconds at five events per second, producing 3,000 sequence numbers. Capacity is 2,000 records, measured in events rather than bytes; all retained records are delivered after reconnection. The buffer retains 2,000/5=400 seconds. Its earliest 1,000 records cannot be recovered from this buffer; the retained fraction is 2,000/3,000=66.666667%.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-085","referenceUrls":["https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/warm-standby.html"],"title":"PostgreSQL 18：replication slot保留WAL與磁碟耗盡界線","titleEn":"PostgreSQL 18: replication-slot WAL retention and disk exhaustion boundaries","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付image-symbol-matrix.csv、plugin-status.json、rerun-manifest.json及analysis-gaps.md；交付包只有合成狀態，不含真實記憶體或秘密。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver image-symbol-matrix.csv, plugin-status.json, rerun-manifest.json and analysis-gaps.md. Include only synthetic status records, no real memory or secrets, and identify each image still excluded from analytical conclusions.","difference":"從合成時間序列追蹤WAL產生、消耗與保留量，估算剩餘容量耗盡時間；把這項容量預測與資料遺失目標分開。","differenceEn":"Track WAL generation, consumption and retained volume in synthetic time series. Estimate time to exhaust available headroom while separating that capacity forecast from any recovery-point or data-loss objective.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["Volatility 3依賴適當符號與記憶體層；符號存在不代表與映像相容，需求失敗屬未知結果，不應建立空的成功程序清單。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 10份合成映像中8份符號相容，其中7份外掛成功、1份讀取失敗；另外2份符號不符。所有建置與檔名皆為教學代號。 符號相容率8/10=80%，可分析覆蓋7/10=70%；相容且失敗的那份不能算成功，兩種比率不可互換。","PostgreSQL replication slot可避免必要WAL被過早回收，也可能保留到填滿磁碟；設定保留上限會改變失聯備援是否仍能追上，不是免費保證。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 已扣除其他使用後可給新增WAL的空間120GB，產生速率6GB/小時，備援消耗0；所有GB採十進位且速率固定。 淨增加6GB/小時，120/6=20小時耗盡；若消耗恢復2GB/小時，淨增加4，耗盡時間延為30小時。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Volatility 3 depends on suitable symbols and memory layers. A symbol file being present does not establish image compatibility; unmet requirements produce an unknown result rather than a successful empty process inventory. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Of ten synthetic images, eight have compatible symbols: seven plugins complete and one encounters a read failure. Two other images have incompatible symbols. Builds and filenames are original teaching identifiers. Symbol compatibility is 8/10=80%, but analyzable coverage is 7/10=70%. The compatible image with failed execution is not successful, and these two proportions cannot substitute for one another.","PostgreSQL replication slots can prevent needed WAL from being recycled, but retention can fill storage. A retention cap changes whether a disconnected standby can catch up; it is not a cost-free guarantee. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. After accounting for other use, 120 decimal GB remain available for additional WAL. Generation is six GB per hour and consumption zero; rates are fixed for this teaching scenario. Net retention grows by six GB per hour, exhausting 120 GB in twenty hours. Restoring consumption to two GB per hour reduces net growth to four and extends exhaustion time to thirty hours.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-7100ed7338e08555","url":"https://docs.velociraptor.app/docs/clients/monitoring/","title":"Velociraptor client monitoring","titleEn":"Velociraptor client monitoring","publisher":"Velociraptor","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-4beae8d416dc5832","url":"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/warm-standby.html","title":"PostgreSQL 18 log-shipping standby servers","titleEn":"PostgreSQL 18 log-shipping standby servers","publisher":"PostgreSQL","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
